<item><title>Senegal awaits sports tribunal ruling on disputed Africa Cup of Nations title</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-awaits-sports-tribunal-ruling-on-disputed-africa-6cfb4c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-awaits-sports-tribunal-ruling-on-disputed-africa-6cfb4c/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The Court of Arbitration for Sport is due to decide by 30 November whether to overturn a ruling that awarded Morocco a 3-0 victory by forfeit.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:00:01 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
